ize:18px;font-weight:600;">SK-2026-000042</p> <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:16px 0;font-size:14px;"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d9cbbf;vertical-align:top;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">DEMO Klaverring</strong><br/> <span style="color:#875543;font-size:12px;">Goud · maat 52 · quantité 1</span></td><td align="right" style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d9cbbf;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;">€ 49,95</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d9cbbf;vertical-align:top;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">DEMO Armband</strong><br/> <span style="color:#875543;font-size:12px;">Zilver · quantité 2</span></td><td align="right" style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d9cbbf;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;">€ 59,90</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:4px 0;padding-top:12px;">Sous-total</td><td align="right" style="padding:4px 0;padding-top:12px;">€ 109,85</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:4px 0;">Réduction (DEMO10)</td><td align="right" style="padding:4px 0;">−€ 10,99</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:4px 0;">Livraison</td><td align="right" style="padding:4px 0;">Gratuite</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:10px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #492520;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;">Total</td><td align="right" style="padding:10px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #492520;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;">€ 98,86</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" style="padding:2px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:#875543;">Dont € 17,16 de TVA (21 %)</td></tr></tbody></table> <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 20px;font-size:14px;"><tbody><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;padding:12px 12px 12px 0;width:50%;"><p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#875543;">Adresse de livraison</p> Ann DEMO<br/>Demostraat 1<br/>1000
